NyatiDraw modifies src/config.rs and src/launch.rs to allow asynchronous
native-renderer retirement before event-loop exit or panic propagation.
Optional startup triage logs in src/app.rs and src/edits.rs record first-stage
initialization and acknowledgement without changing retry behavior.
